  ('6b02ae24-4ec4-52cd-9143-55706fac0199', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g3-theme-summary'), null, 'medium',
   $q$Which sentence is the best summary of the fable?$q$, $q$[{"text":"A monkey follows a butterfly far into the jungle and gets lost there.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"Parrot shows Monkey the way home, and Owl learns to talk more.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-characters"},{"text":"Parrot's talking confuses a lost monkey, but Owl listens and helps Monkey get home.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Owl and Parrot fly through the jungle looking for a waterfall and a pond.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Parrot's talking confuses a lost monkey, but Owl listens and helps Monkey get home.$q$, $q$This choice tells the problem, how each bird responds, and the ending. The choice about the butterfly tells only how the story begins.$q$, 'draft', '7b31b983-d958-5e59-99f3-f5eeb4f6a8ef')
